## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat-2.5-Preview
- **Short description:** Meituan's API-only preview of its next LongCat model — a natively multimodal MoE (~1.6T total / ~48B active per BenchmarkList) aimed at long-horizon agent work (terminals, browsers, GUIs, spreadsheets, design tools) with image understanding and Claude Code-style harness compatibility.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`; Blackbox AI `blackboxai/meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions at `https://enterprise.blackbox.ai/v1/chat/completions`).
- **Release / knowledge:** released 2026-09-25 (OpenCode data; Blackbox lists Sep 26, 2026); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (Zen), `blackboxai/meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (Blackbox). Closed weights — no open-weights release (unlike LongCat 2.0).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (1M); max output 131,072 tokens (OpenCode data, Blackbox spec sheet).
- **Modalities:** text and image in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calling yes; structured outputs / response_format supported (Blackbox spec sheet).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** $0.30 in / $1.20 out per 1M, cached input $0.006 (OpenCode Zen; Blackbox matches) — BenchmarkList notes this is a limited-time promotional price. No Free ID verified.
- **Architecture:** proprietary closed-weight MoE, ~1.6T total / ~48B active (BenchmarkList model summary).

